7
00:00:07,900 --> 00:00:09,740
Rockstar never told anyone about these.

8
00:00:10,060 --> 00:00:12,259
Players found them in GTA 6, in just

9
00:00:12,259 --> 00:00:12,599
days.

10
00:00:13,019 --> 00:00:14,060
Here are eighteen secrets.

11
00:00:14,339 --> 00:00:14,960
And number eighteen?

12
00:00:15,240 --> 00:00:15,919
It's out of this world.

13
00:00:16,839 --> 00:00:17,399
Part one.

14
00:00:17,620 --> 00:00:18,879
Hidden in plain sight.

15
00:00:19,280 --> 00:00:21,379
These are the secrets that were right in

16
00:00:21,379 --> 00:00:23,219
front of everyone, if you knew where to

17
00:00:23,219 --> 00:00:24,879
