18
00:00:25,839 --> 00:00:26,539
Number one.

19
00:00:26,699 --> 00:00:27,539
The money cheat.

20
00:00:27,980 --> 00:00:30,800
Yes, GTA 6 has cheat codes again.

21
00:00:30,800 --> 00:00:34,979
Press up, right, down, left, up, left, down,

22
00:00:35,219 --> 00:00:37,780
