35
00:01:01,460 --> 00:01:03,640
If a code does nothing, that is probably

36
00:01:03,640 --> 00:01:04,340
why.

37
00:01:05,180 --> 00:01:05,780
Number two.

38
00:01:06,140 --> 00:01:08,620
The first person mode that does not exist.

39
00:01:09,299 --> 00:01:12,439
Rockstar did not include an official first person

40
00:01:12,439 --> 00:01:13,379
mode at launch.

41
00:01:13,939 --> 00:01:15,239
Players did not care.

42
00:01:15,719 --> 00:01:17,560
One player found a way to get it

43
00:01:17,560 --> 00:01:20,420
anyway, by remapping the camera button and using

44
00:01:20,420 --> 00:01:22,120
the phone inside a vehicle.

45
00:01:22,879 --> 00:01:24,379
And the strangest part?

46
00:01:24,700 --> 00:01:27,459
The camera even moves with the character's head

47
00:01:27,459 --> 00:01:28,299
