48
00:01:29,200 --> 00:01:30,700
Officially, it is not there.

49
00:01:31,319 --> 00:01:33,840
Unofficially, people are already playing with it.

50
00:01:34,099 --> 00:01:36,099
Would you play the whole story like that?

51
00:01:36,359 --> 00:01:39,180
Let me know, because I honestly cannot decide.

52
00:01:40,400 --> 00:01:41,019
Number three.

53
00:01:41,299 --> 00:01:42,640
An actual Easter egg.

54
00:01:43,200 --> 00:01:45,659
Somewhere in Leonida there is a giant tower,

55
00:01:45,659 --> 00:01:48,379
and climbing it takes around six to seven

56
00:01:48,379 --> 00:01:48,739
minutes.

57
00:01:49,219 --> 00:01:51,180
Most players would give up halfway.

58
00:01:51,180 --> 00:01:53,459
The ones who did not found a bird's

59
00:01:53,459 --> 00:01:55,760
nest at the very top, full of painted

60
00:01:55,760 --> 00:01:56,299
eggs.

61
00:01:56,719 --> 00:01:58,120
A real Easter egg.

62
00:01:58,620 --> 00:02:00,239
And if you throw one off the tower,

63
00:02:00,439 --> 00:02:02,859
a short cutscene plays, and the egg smashes

64
00:02:02,859 --> 00:02:04,900
