65
00:02:05,560 --> 00:02:07,560
Long time fans noticed something else.

66
00:02:08,020 --> 00:02:11,199
GTA Vice City, back in 2002, also hid

67
00:02:11,199 --> 00:02:12,300
a literal Easter egg.

68
00:02:12,900 --> 00:02:15,039
Rockstar just did it again, twenty four years

69
00:02:15,039 --> 00:02:15,500
later.

70
00:02:15,939 --> 00:02:18,379
Same joke, a whole new generation of players,

71
00:02:18,379 --> 00:02:19,819
and a much longer climb.

72
00:02:20,539 --> 00:02:21,259
Number four.

73
00:02:21,419 --> 00:02:22,020
The way down.

74
00:02:22,419 --> 00:02:24,199
Climbing for seven minutes is one thing.

75
00:02:24,340 --> 00:02:25,639
Climbing back down is another.

76
00:02:26,060 --> 00:02:27,979
But reports say there is a parachute waiting

77
00:02:27,979 --> 00:02:29,560
at the top of that same tower.

78
00:02:29,900 --> 00:02:31,379
So you get the egg, you throw it,

79
00:02:31,379 --> 00:02:33,060
and then you base jump off the tower

80
00:02:33,060 --> 00:02:34,080
like nothing happened.

81
00:02:34,560 --> 00:02:36,419
That is the GTA way to leave a

82
00:02:36,419 --> 00:02:36,680
building.

83
00:02:37,159 --> 00:02:38,879
And it means you can grab a parachute

84
00:02:38,879 --> 00:02:41,400
