85
00:02:41,400 --> 00:02:41,680
one.

86
00:02:42,919 --> 00:02:43,599
Part two.

87
00:02:43,860 --> 00:02:45,560
Movie and TV tributes.

88
00:02:46,460 --> 00:02:49,699
Rockstar loves pop culture, and this time the

89
00:02:49,699 --> 00:02:53,180
references are hiding in garages, trunks and apartment

90
00:02:53,180 --> 00:02:53,800
blocks.

91
00:02:54,960 --> 00:02:55,500
Number five.

92
00:02:55,939 --> 00:02:56,860
Paul Walker's car.

93
00:02:57,500 --> 00:03:00,120
In a villa garage on Vespucci Island, in

94
00:03:00,120 --> 00:03:03,419
Vice City, players found a green Maibatsu Penumbra

95
00:03:03,419 --> 00:03:03,860
F F.

96
00:03:04,560 --> 00:03:06,439
If that looks familiar, it should.

97
00:03:07,039 --> 00:03:08,727
It is a tribute to the green nineteen

98
00:03:08,727 --> 00:03:12,539
ninety five Mitsubishi Eclipse that Brian O'Conner drove

99
00:03:12,539 --> 00:03:15,180
in the first Fast and Furious, back in

100
00:03:15,180 --> 00:03:16,020
2001.

101
00:03:16,020 --> 00:03:19,879
Paul Walker played Brian, and this is Rockstar's

102
00:03:19,879 --> 00:03:21,259
quiet tribute to him.

103
00:03:21,719 --> 00:03:24,039
Even better, you can take it very early

104
00:03:24,039 --> 00:03:26,219
in the game, and it is yours to

105
00:03:26,219 --> 00:03:26,520
keep.

106
00:03:26,960 --> 00:03:29,080
But before you drive off, there is one

107
00:03:29,080 --> 00:03:31,259
more thing you should know about that car.

108
00:03:32,560 --> 00:03:33,199
Number six.

109
00:03:33,560 --> 00:03:34,659
The snake in the trunk.

110
00:03:35,219 --> 00:03:36,840
Rockstar did not stop there.

111
00:03:37,080 --> 00:03:38,680
If you open the trunk of that car,

112
00:03:38,879 --> 00:03:40,960
a snake jumps out and attacks you.

113
00:03:41,360 --> 00:03:43,599
Players instantly recognized the joke.

114
00:03:43,599 --> 00:03:45,639
There is a snake in my boot.

115
00:03:46,020 --> 00:03:48,219
Yes, that is the Toy Story line, and

116
00:03:48,219 --> 00:03:50,280
yes, Rockstar hid it in the trunk of

117
00:03:50,280 --> 00:03:52,099
a Fast and Furious tribute.

118
00:03:52,819 --> 00:03:55,099
Two movie references in one car.

119
00:03:55,099 --> 00:03:57,340
And here is a fun coincidence.

120
00:03:58,240 --> 00:04:01,939
Toy Story came out in 1995, the same

121
00:04:01,939 --> 00:04:03,780
model year as that Eclipse.

122
00:04:04,800 --> 00:04:07,759
Rockstar's artists clearly had a lot of fun

123
00:04:07,759 --> 00:04:08,759
with this garage.

124
00:04:10,000 --> 00:04:10,639
Number seven.

125
00:04:11,120 --> 00:04:12,060
Dexter's apartment.

126
00:04:12,060 --> 00:04:14,960
Fans of the show Dexter spotted a building

127
00:04:14,960 --> 00:04:17,879
