Rockstar has not confirmed it as a tribute.

130
00:04:25,379 --> 00:04:28,100
But the community is convinced, and honestly, it

131
00:04:28,100 --> 00:04:30,019
is hard to argue with them after number

132
00:04:30,019 --> 00:04:30,459
eight.

133
00:04:31,339 --> 00:04:31,779
Number eight.

134
00:04:31,980 --> 00:04:33,040
The kill kit and the boat.

135
00:04:33,540 --> 00:04:35,740
Players who explored the area reported finding a

136
00:04:35,740 --> 00:04:37,279
collection of tools that look a lot like

137
00:04:37,279 --> 00:04:38,439
Dexter's signature kit.

138
00:04:38,439 --> 00:04:40,279
And nearby, there is a boat that looks

139
00:04:40,279 --> 00:04:41,800
just like his boat from the show, the

140
00:04:41,800 --> 00:04:42,439
Slice of Life.

141
00:04:42,860 --> 00:04:44,279
Players say you can even steal it.

142
00:04:44,579 --> 00:04:45,620
Rockstar has said nothing.

143
00:04:46,000 --> 00:04:47,939
Which, for Rockstar, is basically a wink.

144
00:04:48,579 --> 00:04:50,279
Dexter was set in Miami, and Vice City

145
00:04:50,279 --> 00:04:51,459
is Rockstar's Miami.

146
00:04:51,959 --> 00:04:53,819
So honestly, it would have been stranger if

147
00:04:53,819 --> 00:04:54,680
they had left him out.

148
00:04:55,819 --> 00:04:58,300
Before we keep going, if you are enjoying

149
00:04:58,300 --> 00:04:59,420
this, subscribe.

150
00:05:00,079 --> 00:05:01,959
It is free, and it tells me to

151
00:05:01,959 --> 00:05:03,100
keep making these.

152
00:05:03,100 --> 00:05:04,439
Part three.

153
00:05:05,019 --> 00:05:06,560
Rockstar's own history.

154
00:05:07,040 --> 00:05:09,540
GTA 6 is full of little winks to

155
00:05:09,540 --> 00:05:11,660
the games that came before it.

156
00:05:12,279 --> 00:05:12,899
Number nine.

157
00:05:13,279 --> 00:05:13,620
Michael's boat.

158
00:05:13,980 --> 00:05:15,379
This one started before launch.

159
00:05:15,939 --> 00:05:17,860
In the second trailer, fans spotted a white

160
00:05:17,860 --> 00:05:20,620
boat with blue stripes parked outside Jason's house.

161
00:05:21,019 --> 00:05:22,879
It looks like the same model Michael owned

162
00:05:22,879 --> 00:05:24,079
in GTA 5.

163
00:05:24,079 --> 00:05:25,199
And here is the twist.

164
00:05:25,819 --> 00:05:28,079
Jason's house belongs to Brian Heder, a man

165
00:05:28,079 --> 00:05:29,480
who also owns a marina.

166
00:05:29,480 --> 00:05:31,959
A marina owner with a stolen looking boat

167
00:05:31,959 --> 00:05:32,560
in his yard?

168
00:05:33,259 --> 00:05:35,000
Fans connected the dots very quickly.

169
00:05:35,459 --> 00:05:37,980
Remember that mission where Michael's boat gets stolen?

170
00:05:38,620 --> 00:05:40,019
Fans think it may have ended up right

171
00:05:40,019 --> 00:05:40,800
here, in Leonida.

172
00:05:41,279 --> 00:05:44,019
Even Michael's voice actor, Ned Luke, joked online

173
00:05:44,019 --> 00:05:45,439
that he was coming for his boat.

174
00:05:45,959 --> 00:05:48,199
Some fans point out small differences, so this

175
00:05:48,199 --> 00:05:49,160
one stays a theory.

176
00:05:49,540 --> 00:05:50,480
But it is a fun one.

177
00:05:50,819 --> 00:05:52,360
And if it is true, it means the

178
00:05:52,360 --> 00:05:55,180
worlds of GTA 5 and GTA 6 are

179
00:05:55,180 --> 00:05:56,939
connected by one stolen boat.

180
00:05:57,660 --> 00:05:58,379
Number ten.

181
00:05:58,800 --> 00:05:59,379
Red Dead money.

182
00:05:59,860 --> 00:06:01,339
Look closely at the cash in the second

183
00:06:01,339 --> 00:06:01,759
trailer.

184
00:06:02,240 --> 00:06:04,079
The faces on the bills are President Hardin

185
00:06:04,079 --> 00:06:06,480
and President Thaddeus Waxman, from the Red Dead

186
00:06:06,480 --> 00:06:07,259
Redemption series.

187
00:06:07,899 --> 00:06:10,220
Those portraits come from Red Dead Redemption 2's

188
00:06:10,220 --> 00:06:11,579
collectible cigarette cards.

189
00:06:12,079 --> 00:06:14,199
So the money in Leonida quietly suggests that

190
00:06:14,199 --> 00:06:16,420
Arthur Morgan's world and Jason and Lucia's world

191
00:06:16,420 --> 00:06:18,660
are the same universe, just a century apart.

192
00:06:19,300 --> 00:06:20,779
Rockstar has never confirmed it.

193
00:06:21,060 --> 00:06:22,060
But it never had to.

194
00:06:22,819 --> 00:06:23,480
Number eleven.

195
00:06:23,759 --> 00:06:24,779
A boat called Leonida.

196
00:06:25,040 --> 00:06:26,439
This one was hiding for years.

197
00:06:26,939 --> 00:06:29,379
In January, a dataminer found a partly unused

198
00:06:29,379 --> 00:06:32,199
boat texture inside Red Dead Redemption 2's files.

199
00:06:32,620 --> 00:06:33,860
It lists several ship names.

200
00:06:33,860 --> 00:06:35,199
And one of them is The Leonida.

201
00:06:35,579 --> 00:06:38,060
Red Dead 2 came out in 2018, long

202
00:06:38,060 --> 00:06:40,019
before anyone knew the name of GTA 6's

203
00:06:40,019 --> 00:06:40,360
state.

204
00:06:40,819 --> 00:06:41,720
Was it a planned tease?

205
00:06:42,040 --> 00:06:43,540
Some say yes, others say it is a

206
00:06:43,540 --> 00:06:43,899
coincidence.

207
00:06:44,519 --> 00:06:46,399
Either way, it is a wild find.

208
00:06:47,339 --> 00:06:47,959
Number twelve.

209
00:06:48,279 --> 00:06:49,319
The Vercetti Estate.

210
00:06:49,779 --> 00:06:51,259
This is not a fan theory.

211
00:06:51,720 --> 00:06:53,360
It comes from Rockstar itself.

212
00:06:53,360 --> 00:06:57,060
The Ultimate Edition includes a pair of revolvers,

213
00:06:57,060 --> 00:07:00,120
and Rockstar's own description says their style was

214
00:07:00,120 --> 00:07:02,959
sourced from the Vercetti Estate, with palm tree

215
00:07:02,959 --> 00:07:03,319
