216
00:07:04,060 --> 00:07:07,319
The Vercetti Estate was Tommy Vercetti's mansion in

217
00:07:07,319 --> 00:07:08,660
GTA Vice City.

218
00:07:09,120 --> 00:07:11,379
It was where he ran his empire, and

219
00:07:11,379 --> 00:07:13,939
where the game's final shootout took place.

220
00:07:14,519 --> 00:07:16,939
Tommy is not in GTA 6.

221
00:07:17,279 --> 00:07:19,779
But his house, it seems, never left.

222
00:07:19,779 --> 00:07:22,720
For anyone who played the original Vice City,

223
00:07:22,980 --> 00:07:25,660
that single line in a product description says

224
00:07:25,660 --> 00:07:26,240
a lot.

225
00:07:27,360 --> 00:07:28,000
Number thirteen.

226
00:07:28,439 --> 00:07:29,439
Games inside the game.

227
00:07:29,699 --> 00:07:31,379
Your safehouse is not just a place to

228
00:07:31,379 --> 00:07:31,699
sleep.

229
00:07:32,220 --> 00:07:34,079
According to Kotaku, you can play real video

230
00:07:34,079 --> 00:07:36,699
games on an in-game console, including first person

231
00:07:36,699 --> 00:07:38,279
and top down shooter mini games.

232
00:07:38,959 --> 00:07:41,160
Rockstar built games, inside a game, inside a

233
00:07:41,160 --> 00:07:42,959
game console that parodies the one you are

234
00:07:42,959 --> 00:07:44,399
