235
00:07:44,740 --> 00:07:46,000
That is three layers deep.

236
00:07:46,000 --> 00:07:48,120
And it is a perfect excuse to stay

237
00:07:48,120 --> 00:07:49,939
inside on a rainy day in Leonida.

238
00:07:51,439 --> 00:07:51,899
Part four.

239
00:07:52,300 --> 00:07:53,819
Leonida's wild side.

240
00:07:54,600 --> 00:07:58,120
Leonida is Rockstar's version of Florida, and Florida

241
00:07:58,120 --> 00:08:00,480
is famous for being a little wild.

242
00:08:01,339 --> 00:08:02,300
Number fourteen.

243
00:08:02,699 --> 00:08:03,500
The fighter jet.

244
00:08:04,019 --> 00:08:07,300
In GTA 5, stealing a jet meant breaking

245
00:08:07,300 --> 00:08:08,500
into Fort Zancudo.

246
00:08:09,240 --> 00:08:11,339
GTA 6 has its own version.

247
00:08:11,339 --> 00:08:14,899
At Mile Zero Air Station, on Goose Key,

248
00:08:15,180 --> 00:08:16,980
there is a fighter jet sitting on the

249
00:08:16,980 --> 00:08:17,319
base.

