258
00:08:35,659 --> 00:08:37,659
Good luck landing it in one piece.

259
00:08:38,600 --> 00:08:39,559
Number fifteen.

260
00:08:40,019 --> 00:08:40,519
Cool Dog.

261
00:08:41,039 --> 00:08:43,080
Swim too far from the shore, and you

262
00:08:43,080 --> 00:08:44,059
might hear barking.

263
00:08:44,580 --> 00:08:46,659
Then a dog in goggles and a life

264
00:08:46,659 --> 00:08:49,200
jacket arrives on a jet ski to rescue

