00:08:49,200 --> 00:08:49,659
you.

266
00:08:50,120 --> 00:08:51,759
Players named him Cool Dog.

267
00:08:52,220 --> 00:08:54,480
If you praise him instead of scolding him,

268
00:08:54,580 --> 00:08:56,440
he lets you ride along to his own

269
00:08:56,440 --> 00:08:56,919
island.

270
00:08:57,720 --> 00:08:59,886
Reports say you can find around twelve hundred

271
00:08:59,886 --> 00:09:01,200
dollars there.

272
00:09:01,639 --> 00:09:02,220
A dog.

273
00:09:02,220 --> 00:09:03,539
On a jet ski.

274
00:09:03,539 --> 00:09:04,679
Giving you money.

275
00:09:04,679 --> 00:09:06,080
Only in Leonida.

276
00:09:06,080 --> 00:09:08,600
If there is one secret in this video

277
00:09:08,600 --> 00:09:10,960
you should try tonight, it is this one.

278
00:09:12,019 --> 00:09:12,799
Number sixteen.

279
00:09:13,419 --> 00:09:13,980
Skunk Ape.

